From 0d75f76fec14da318db705854f94a2fac9533621 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:36:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix(trace): Smoothness sets how many corners the outline
 keeps (ADR-395)

Smoothness now behaves like LightBurn's control and potrace's alphamax on
every kind of source: 0 draws only straight segments, 1.33 draws no
corners, and the default 1 leaves today's outline untouched. Before, it
only set the wobble flattener, which never runs on anti-aliased sources,
so on most images the slider did nothing, and above 1 it could not remove
a corner.

Below 1, contour-smoothness.ts measures potrace's corner alpha on a 1 px
polygon of each loop and makes every bend whose alpha reaches
4/3 x Smoothness a corner; at 0 the outline is that polygon. Above 1,
contour-corner-rounding.ts rounds the corners the finisher kept, weakest
first, all of them at 1.33. A rounding reaches 0.45 of the shorter
neighbouring polygon side, at most 8 source px, so a 12-point star keeps
its points and a large square keeps its sides. Edge Detection gets the
same control.

Presets: Sharp keeps 0.55 ("crisp corners"); it now also makes every bend
with alpha 0.73 or more a corner. Smooth keeps 1: every step above 1
scored worse (AA corpus IoU 0.8849 at 1, 0.8846 at 1.1, 0.8836 at 1.2,
0.8814 at 1.33; 1-bit 0.8710, 0.8694, 0.8673, 0.8659).

Measured with the bench runner on the 12-image AA corpus, its 12-image
1-bit version, and the logo and dragon (arch-house-langebaan-source,
centerline-stress-test-20260909):
- At default, Line Art, Smooth and Edge Detection are byte-identical to
  85ee406 on all 26 images. Sharp changes as intended.
- Drawn corners (vertices turning 10 degrees or more that carry at least
  half the turning within 2 px), Line Art, at Smoothness
  0 / 0.3 / 0.6 / 0.83 / 1 / 1.33:
    AA corpus    1838 / 712 / 371 / 260 / 243 / 76
    logo+dragon  24484 / 12381 / 8695 / 7274 / 7189 / 1276
  potrace 1.16 (-t 2 -O 0.2, luma <= 128) at the same alphamax values on
  the AA corpus: 1510 / 1151 / 859 / 699 / 553 / 455.
  Every step changes at least 4 of the 12 AA images and both real ones.
- Sharp before -> after (IoU, mean deviation px, nodes):
    AA corpus  0.9343 -> 0.9373, 0.1217 -> 0.1152, 15879 -> 16495
    1-bit      0.9107 -> 0.9129, 0.1865 -> 0.1821, 15420 -> 16804

Known limit, unchanged from 85ee406: at 1.33 the wobble flattener runs at
strength 2.98 and the 1-bit 12-point star crosses itself, so the topology
repair falls back to its pixel staircase.

